Package: plasma-wallpaper-stereo-image
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libstereo-layer1 (>= 1.4.2~), plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7.4), kimageformat6-plugins (>= 6.30.0-1+stereo3d2)
Description: Stereo picture wallpaper for Plasma
 The Stereo Image wallpaper shows a stereo picture (MPO, JPS, PNG with the
 sTER chunk, a marked or content-tested side-by-side pair) as the desktop's
 background: both views in 3D on a screen in a 3D mode, the left view on a
 2D screen. The picture gets its own declared surface below the desktop, so
 icons and widgets stay flat. It is the Image wallpaper with the shared
 stereo policy of libstereo-layer, and takes its pictures and settings.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo"
 Pijanowski).
